<div dir="ltr" style="position:relative;--radix-scroll-area-corner-width:0px;--radix-scroll-area-corner-height:0px">
<div data-radix-scroll-area-viewport="" style="overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:scroll">
<div style="min-width:100%;display:table">
<div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;">
<div>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<h1>Execution Analytics</h1>
<p>Generate missing activity summaries and success scores for agent executions</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<h2>Execution Analytics &amp; Accuracy Monitoring</h2>
<p>Generate missing activity summaries and success scores for agent executions. After generation, accuracy trends and alerts will automatically be displayed to help monitor agent health over time.</p>
<!--$-->
<div>
<form>
<div>
<div>
<label for="graph_id">Graph ID <span>*</span>
</label>
<input id="graph_id" placeholder="Enter graph/agent ID" required="" value="" style="">
</div>
<div>
<label for="graph_version">Graph Version</label>
<input id="graph_version" placeholder="Optional - leave empty for all versions" type="number" value="" style="">
</div>
<div>
<label for="user_id">User ID</label>
<input id="user_id" placeholder="Optional - leave empty for all users" value="" style="">
</div>
<div>
<label for="created_after">Created After</label>
<input id="created_after" type="datetime-local" value="" style="">
</div>
<div>
<label for="model_name">AI Model</label>
<button type="button" role="combobox" aria-controls="radix-_r_6_" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="none" dir="ltr" data-state="closed">
